                <pb facs="0393" n="359" xml:id="pg359"/>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Treaty for the Re-Establishment of an Independent
                        and Democratic Austria</hi> (<hi rendition="#small-caps">Second Report of
                        the Deputies</hi>—CFM/47/M/82, CFM/47/M/130)<anchor n="89" xml:id="d139-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Article 39, paragraphs 1, 2, 3 and 5</hi>
                </p>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Agreed</hi>. The U.S. Delegation withdrew its proposal
                    in paragraph 1 (e).</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Article 39, paragraph 4</hi>
                </p>
                <p>Referred back for consideration by the Deputies.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Article 39, paragraph 6</hi>
                </p>
                <p>The U.S. Delegation reserved its position until adoption of a decision on Article
                    35.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Article 40</hi>
                </p>
                <p>Combined with Article 38.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Article 41</hi>
                </p>
                <p>After an exchange of views a decision was <hi rendition="#italic"
                    >postponed</hi>.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Article 42, paragraphs 1, 2 and 3</hi>
                </p>
                <p>After an exchange of views a decision was <hi rendition="#italic"
                    >postponed</hi>.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Article 42, paragraph 4, sub-paragraphs</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">a</hi>), (<hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">and</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>)</p>
                <p>After an exchange of views a decision was <hi rendition="#italic">postponed</hi>.
                    The Delegation of France withdrew its proposal (No. 10) and adopted the U.K.
                    proposal (No. 12); the U.S. Delegation also adopted this proposal, reserving its
                    position in regard to Article 44.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Article 42, paragraph 4, sub-paragraph</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">d</hi>)</p>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Agreed</hi>. The Soviet Delegation withdrew its
                    addendum.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Article paragraphs 5, 6 and 7.</hi>
                </p>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Agreed</hi>. The Soviet Delegation withdrew its addenda
                    concerning paragraph 6.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Article 42, paragraph 8</hi>
                </p>
                <p>Referred to the Drafting Committee.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Article 42, paragraph 9.</hi>
                </p>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Postponed</hi>.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Article 42, paragraph 10</hi>
                </p>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Agreed</hi>.</p>
